\engtitle{.. paramArthacharchA ..}##
\itxtitle{.. paramArthacharchA ..}##\endtitles ##
arkendudIpAdyavabhAsabhinnaM nAbhAtyativyAptatayA tatashcha |
prakAsharUpaM tadiyat prakAshyaprakAshatAkhyA vyavahAra eva || 1||
j~nAnadvibhinno na hi kashchidarthaH tattatkR^itaH saMvidi nAsti bhedaH |
svaya.nprakAshAchChatamaikadhAmni prAtisvikI nApi vibheditA syAt || 2||
itthaM svasaMvidghana eka eva shivaH sa vishvasya paraH prakAshaH|
tatrApi bhAtyeva vichitrashaktau grAhmagR^ihItR^ipravibhAgabhedaH || 3||
bhedaH sa chAyaM na tato vibhinnaH svachChandasusvachChatamaikadhAmnaH|
prAsAdahastyashvapayodasindhugiryAdi yadvanmaNidarpaNAdeH || 4||
AdarshakukSho pratibimbakAri sabimbakaM syAdyadi mAnasiddham |
svachChandasaMvinmukurAntarAle bhAveShu hetvantaramasti nAnyat || 5||
saMvidghanastena parastvameva tvayyeva vishvAni chakAsati drAk |
sphuranti cha tvanmahasaH prabhAvAt tvameva chaiShAM parameshakartA || 6||
itthaM svasaMvedanamAdisiddhamasAdhyamAtmAnamanIshamIsham |
svashaktisampUrNavadeshakAlaM nityaM vibhuM bhairavanAthamIDe || 7||
sadvR^ittasaptakamidaM galitAnyachintAH
      samyak smaranti hR^idaye paramArthakAmAH |
te bhairavIyaparadhAma muhurvishanti
      jAnanti cha trijagatIparamArthacharchAm || 8||

|| iti shrImadabhinavaguptavirachitA paramArthacharchA samAptA ||

